      "extract": "General relativity (GR) deepens our view on space-time. In parallel, the appearance of quantum field theory (QFT) gives us a different view of particles, fields and the measurement process. One approach for the unification of QFT and GR, to a quantum gravity, starts with a proposal to quantize GR and its underlying structure, space-time. Here, there is a unique opinion in the community about the relation between",
